  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danida contract Assessment and scoring of applications for Strategic Partnerships 2022 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the assignment is to support the MFA in assessing and scoring the incoming applications in full application round.

This entails developing and applying methods and tools for assessment, training assessment team members from MFA and scoring all proposals. I also includes secretarial functions of the assessment team.</narrative>
